  "summary": "“Building solutions, learning constantly, and turning challenges into opportunities.”\n\nThat’s been the theme of my career as a software developer. Over the past 8+ years, I’ve built customer-facing features and scalable systems across SaaS platforms, startups, and freelance projects. From crafting intuitive frontends with React and TypeScript to developing resilient backend services with Node and Python, I thrive on transforming ideas into reliable, user-focused products.\n\nAt ZenBusiness, I played an important role in shaping platforms that helped entrepreneurs launch and grow their businesses. I designed integrations, enhanced observability, and built, updated, and maintained microservices in cloud-native environments. As a freelancer, I partnered with clients to deliver end-to-end solutions that balanced design, performance, and scalability.\n\nBeyond the code, I enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams, mentoring peers, and simplifying complex problems into actionable solutions. I bring curiosity, perseverance, and a people-first mindset to every project. Whether it is scaling an application, improving system reliability, or building tools that empower users, I focus on creating lasting impact.\n\nOutside of work, I am a husband and father of three, and I carry the same sense of adventure and growth mindset into family life, learning, and new experiences.\n\nIf you are passionate about building innovative solutions, scaling SaaS platforms, or sharing stories about tech and career growth, I would love to connect.",
